# Stop is a pause: note-offs for sounding notes, then continue picks
# up where it stopped (the held note is not resounded). Restart goes
# back to beat 0 for every track, taking a waiting version at once.
open virtual
track 1 60:2 62:2
track 2 72:3
play continue
runto 3
play stop
log
state
play stop
play continue
runto 6
log
track 1 48:1
play restart
runto 2
log
state
